  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multicultural educ com - Mulitcultural edu com</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildnr&#xe5;d i m&#xe5;ngkulturel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Education Councils for Indigenous peoples in Bolivia CEPOs has the role of the informing, promoting and doing follow-up of the multicultural component of the Education Reform in Bolivia. Together with the Ministry of Education the CEPOs are responsible of  formulating the guidelines for the education in the area of  pluriculturalism and bilingual education.</narrative>
  </description>
